.TH LSETXATTR 3crunch "" "Crunch" "Crunch Library Manual"
.SH NAME
lsetxattr \- sets an extended attribute on path without following the final symbolic link
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include <sys/xattr.h>
.B int lsetxattr(const char* path, const char* name, const void* value, size_t size, int flags);
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Sets an extended attribute on path without following the final symbolic link.
.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns the syscall result, or \-1 with errno set.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR lsetxattr (2)
